ling\n读出1·测量时间：37.5 min mean TUS offset to scanning onset; SEM 2.21 min\n读出1·结果描述：coupling with interconnected regions reduced after sonication, specific to targeted areas; no graph means digitized\n原文样本统计：{\"\"count\"\": 4, \"\"scope\"\": \"\"amygdala TUS experiment 1\"\", \"\"unit\"\": \"\"macaques\"\"}\n原文样本统计：{\"\"count\"\": 9, \"\"scope\"\": \"\"control without stimulation; broader control set, not added to TUS n\"\", \"\"unit\"\": \"\"macaques\"\"}\n对照：no-TUS sessions mirrored anesthesia, prescan preparation, fMRI acquisition and timing\n对照：ACC target experiment as regional comparator; excluded from selected condition\",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,checked,资料整理,2026-10-25,仅对应现有记录及所列来源；未审核论文全部条件和补充材料。,corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-4ebecf1dda4f;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-fb66bfa76e8d;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-41a61387d6d7;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-c9e09d9d9cbe;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-75b084b340c5;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-caf526e080d2;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-b7d5275d29ea;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-150f0ade2d6b;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-434e725eb125;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-ef7354ad76f2;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-bf3986bd96a2;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-52aa5e49929f;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-2117d3fa10be;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-96e4c9b8814c;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-fea582e62c0e;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-9f0f6f364189;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-ae218d63d275;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-7df0e8141488;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-5bffc18d7a21;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-d682439abe3f;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-fa1d14e95f75;corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-a-333c851f05d6,,corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-study,corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-protocol-1,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,\r\npages-2492a8f19d5425f9,pages,corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-condition-1,Experiment 1 — bilateral amygdala offline TUS,timing_semantics,timing-corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-condition-1-session,,,,,,,definition,所选实验刺激安排：one 40 s train to each amygdala; applied sequentially。该层只说明安排，未把测量随访时点转换成声照射事件。,,,exact,,,,,anchor-research-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-timing-corpus-p-1eaa8d30f6a1-protocol-1-session,,,,,,,,,,,check